# What does NOT get uploaded to Vercel.
#
# The moment this file exists, .gitignore stops being consulted — so anything
# that must stay off the build machine has to be named here, including the
# things .gitignore already covers. That is the trap in this file.
#
# Keep `certs/` OUT of this list. certs/supabase-ca.crt is what makes the
# database connection verify who it is talking to; without it the connection
# still works and is still encrypted, so its absence is invisible.
# See docs/project/database.md and certs/README.md.

.git
node_modules

# Secrets. Production values live in the Vercel project's environment settings,
# never in a file that gets uploaded.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Built here, not shipped from here.
dist

# Articles on this laptop. Production reads them out of Postgres.
data
output

# Nothing in the build or the running server reads any of these.
docs
evals
tests
test
example
supabase
scratch-*
